# Changes to these paths need review from a maintainer. They are where the
# PolinRider malware hides: build/lint configs that execute on load, editor
# and devcontainer automation, lockfiles and install scripts, and binaries.
.vscode/                @simeontech
.devcontainer/          @simeontech
.github/                @simeontech
.gitignore              @simeontech
**/package.json         @simeontech
**/package-lock.json    @simeontech
**/*.config.*           @simeontech
**/.eslintrc*           @simeontech
**/*.woff               @simeontech
**/*.woff2              @simeontech
**/*.eot                @simeontech
**/*.ttf                @simeontech
**/*.otf                @simeontech
**/*.wasm               @simeontech
**/*.bat                @simeontech
**/*.sh                 @simeontech
